## 11. Student Clubs

The college has several student organizations:

- Coding Club: Organizes programming contests and coding workshops.
- Robotics Club: Develops robotics and embedded systems projects.
- Literary Club: Conducts debates, writing competitions, and discussions.
- Entrepreneurship Club: Supports startup ideas and business development.
