Students can register for clubs through the student portal.

## 12. Disciplinary Rules

Students must follow the institution's code of conduct.

Ragging is strictly prohibited.

Students must maintain discipline in classrooms, laboratories, libraries, and hostels.

Damage to college property may result in disciplinary action and financial penalties.

Students must use their official college email accounts for academic communication.
